[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: ETH-W5500 Extension System Architecture
UID: ETH-SYA
VERSION: 0.1
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: architecture.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Architecture of the W5500 Ethernet extension. The W5500 contains MAC,
PHY and a hardwired TCP/IP stack and is driven over SPI, so the host
needs no Ethernet MAC (important for the ESP32-S3, which has none).
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Blocks

[BLOCK]
UID: ETH-SYA-001
STATUS: Draft
KIND: System
TITLE: ETH-W5500 extension
DESCRIPTION: >>>
Plug-on board for J7 of the KM271-WiFi with W5500, magnetics and RJ45 jack.
<<<
REALIZATION: EXTENSIONS/ETH_W5500/ETH_W5500.kicad_sch
