[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Interfaces

[INTERFACE]
UID: ETH-SYA-100
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Electrical
TITLE: Host connector (J1)
DESCRIPTION: 2x5 socket mating with J7 of the main board.
SIGNALS: >>>
- 1: 5VBUD (+5V of the main board, to JP5)
- 2: 3V3BUD (+3V3 of the main board, to JP4)
- 3: nCS (GPIO10)
- 4: SCL_X (GPIO9, not used by the W5500)
- 5: MISO (GPIO13)
- 6: SDA_X = W5500 RSTn (GPIO16)
- 7: MOSI (GPIO11)
- 8: nINT (GPIO14)
- 9: SCLK (GPIO12)
- 10: GND
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
GPIO numbers for the v2.0 ESP32-S3 board. On v1.x (ESP32): nCS 15, MISO 19,
RST 13, MOSI 23, INT 14, SCLK 18.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-103

[INTERFACE]
UID: ETH-SYA-101
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Electrical
TITLE: Network port (J2)
DESCRIPTION: >>>
RJ45 with link (green) and activity LEDs, 10/100 Mbit/s, auto-negotiation.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ETH-SYS-004

[INTERFACE]
UID: ETH-SYA-102
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Power
TITLE: PoE module connector (J3)
DESCRIPTION: 2x4 Micro-MaTch, 1.27 mm.
SIGNALS: 1/2: POE_A1/A2, 3/4: POE_B1/B2, 5: +3.3V, 6: +5V, 7/8: GND
